  {
    "id": "internet-mentions-late-90s",
    "source": "To be sure, our worries will continue to reflect the times: mentions of the internet and new technology in questions notably increased throughout the late \u201890s.",
    "claim": "Questions mentioning the internet are absent in every year through 1994, then appear 2 times in 1995, 1 in 1996, 3 in 1997, 6 in 1998 and 2 in 1999, reaching 12 in 2003.",
    "tables": {"d": "data/raw_da_qs.csv"},
    "code": "d.assign(h=d.question_only.str.lower().str.contains(r'\\binternet\\b')).groupby('year').h.sum()"
  },
  {
    "id": "transgender-mentions-2010s",
    "source": "Along with greater representation in mainstream media (Orange Is The New Black, Transparent), questions surrounding transgender issues\u2014such as readers expressing their desire to transition or trying to cope with falling in love with transgender individuals\u2014began to grow in popularity in the 2010s.",
    "claim": "No question mentions transgender before 2000, when there is one mention, and after a single mention in 2009 the term appears 3 times in 2013, 4 in 2014, 1 in 2016 and 4 in 2017.",
    "tables": {"d": "data/raw_da_qs.csv"},
    "code": "d.assign(h=d.question_only.str.lower().str.contains('transgender')).groupby('year').h.sum()"
  }
]

